{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21960","headline":"慈乌夜啼 · 白居易","name":"慈乌夜啼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慈乌失其母，哑哑吐哀音。\n昼夜不飞去，经年守故林。\n夜夜夜半啼，闻者爲沾襟。\n声中如告诉，未尽反哺心。\n百鸟岂无母，尔独哀怨深。\n应是母慈重，使尔悲不任。\n昔有吴起者，母殁丧不临。\n嗟哉斯徒辈，其心不如禽。\n慈乌复慈乌，鸟中之曾参。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}